  "description": "Fleet-wide AI inference: gateway routing and provider failover by model, request latency and TTFT, token flow, FinOps token-spend accounting, and ops-health (failovers, overload, decode speed). Engine-local health lives in the llama-cpp and halogen-flash dashboards.",
